{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04007","headline":"晦日重宴 · 周彦晖","name":"晦日重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春华归柳树，俯景落蓂枝。\n置驿铜街右，开筵玉浦陲。\n林烟含障密，竹雨带珠危。\n兴阑巾倒戴，山公下习池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周彦晖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}